  "body_html": "<p>Insex is def. an outstanding legend in the cyber world. A true revolution. An S&amp;M icon so high, that can never be reached, even in an era when everything is free &amp; loading for a second through the well known you…somethingelse.com websites. Cause where is the quality and the following of the product… and tell me, where, where is the pain?</p>\n<p>The art, I mean.</p>\n<p>However, <strong>Graphic Sexual Terror </strong>is a great documentary telling the story behind the website. Deep, well edited, yet looking spontaneous enough. Good development of the characters too. Definitely can’t be boring.</p>\n<p>Extreme. Yes.</p>\n<p>Exciting. You’re gonna tell me…</p>\n<p>Click on the very  first picture if you dare.</p>\n<p>Here are some screenshots:</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://flowersinthebarrelofagun.files.wordpress.com/2012/04/5.png\"><img alt=\"\" class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-618\" height=\"258\" src=\"http://flowersinthebarrelofagun.files.wordpress.com/2012/04/5.png\" title=\"5\" width=\"460\"/></a><a href=\"http://flowersinthebarrelofagun.files.wordpress.com/2012/04/m111.png\"><img alt=\"\" class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-623\" height=\"258\" src=\"http://flowersinthebarrelofagun.files.wordpress.com/2012/04/m111.png\" title=\"m111\" width=\"460\"/></a><a href=\"http://flowersinthebarrelofagun.files.wordpress.com/2012/04/10.png\"><img alt=\"\" class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-619\" height=\"258\" src=\"http://flowersinthebarrelofagun.files.wordpress.com/2012/04/10.png\" title=\"10\" width=\"460\"/></a><a href=\"http://flowersinthebarrelofagun.files.wordpress.com/2012/04/11.png\"><img alt=\"\" class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-620\" height=\"258\" src=\"http://flowersinthebarrelofagun.files.wordpress.com/2012/04/11.png\" title=\"11\" width=\"460\"/></a><a href=\"http://flowersinthebarrelofagun.files.wordpress.com/2012/04/beg.png\"><img alt=\"\" class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-621\" height=\"258\" src=\"http://flowersinthebarrelofagun.files.wordpress.com/2012/04/beg.png\" title=\"beg\" width=\"460\"/></a><a href=\"http://flowersinthebarrelofagun.files.wordpress.com/2012/04/f.png\"><img alt=\"\" class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-622\" height=\"258\" src=\"http://flowersinthebarrelofagun.files.wordpress.com/2012/04/f.png\" title=\"f\" width=\"460\"/></a><a href=\"http://flowersinthebarrelofagun.files.wordpress.com/2012/04/untitled.png\"><img alt=\"\" class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-624\" height=\"258\" src=\"http://flowersinthebarrelofagun.files.wordpress.com/2012/04/untitled.png\" title=\"Untitled\" width=\"460\"/></a></p>\n<p>ps: PD is<strong> the sickest.</strong> Marquis De Sade of the cyber world. Period. And he lives somewhere close by…</p>",
